1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,445
Tasks can also be queued from any shell

2
00:00:02,495 --> 00:00:12,445
herdr-orchestrator task create "..."
This fake agent will add a database migration

3
00:00:12,495 --> 00:00:19,445
The default policy never lets a migration through silently:
the run stops and waits for you

4
00:00:19,495 --> 00:00:22,945
prefix + shift+O opens the orchestrator

5
00:00:22,995 --> 00:00:25,045
a lists everything waiting for your decision

6
00:00:25,095 --> 00:00:30,445
Why it stopped, what changed, and the exact policy rule that matched

7
00:00:30,495 --> 00:00:33,545
y approves this one action. The policy itself stays the same.

8
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:41,480
The run finishes. The decision is recorded in a tamper-evident audit log.

